  '適用對象與使用方式': 'Who it is for and how to use it',
  '服務面向希望記錄個人交易並檢視習慣的使用者。你可以手動輸入、匯入自己有權使用的檔案，或主動使用辨識與分析功能；請保留原始對帳單，核對日期、方向、數量、費用、稅款及幣別，再依需要匯出備份。不同市場與券商的欄位和結算規則不盡相同，平台整理結果不應取代券商對帳單。': 'The service is for people who want to record their own trades and review their habits. You can enter trades manually, import files you are authorized to use, or choose recognition and analysis features. Keep original statements and check dates, side, quantity, fees, taxes, and currency; export backups as needed. Fields and settlement rules vary by market and broker, so these summaries do not replace broker statements.',
  '使用者責任': 'Your responsibilities',
  '請只匯入你有權處理的資料，確認檔案來源並保護登入憑證。平台的 OCR、匯率換算、費用分類及統計可能有誤差；如需報稅、會計或正式損益證明，請以券商或交易所正式文件及合格專業人士意見為準。': 'Import only information you are authorized to handle, verify file sources, and protect your sign-in credentials. OCR, currency conversion, fee categorization, and statistics may be inaccurate. For tax filing, accounting, or formal proof of P&L, rely on official broker/exchange documents and qualified professionals.',
  '我們想解決的問題': 'Why we built it',
  '交易記錄分散在券商對帳單、交易所匯出檔、截圖和個人筆記時，很難回頭理解當時為何進場、付了哪些成本，以及哪些做法需要調整。交易手記的方向，是讓紀錄、統計和復盤在同一個私人空間中銜接，幫助使用者從自己留下的資料學習。': 'When trade records are scattered across broker statements, exchange exports, screenshots, and personal notes, it is hard to revisit why a trade was opened, what it cost, or what to change. Trade Journal aims to bring records, statistics, and review together in one private workspace so people can learn from their own history.',
  '了解交易手記的定位、資料處理方式，以及你可使用的資料權利。': 'Learn what Trade Journal does, how it handles information, and which data controls are available to you.',
  '關於我們說明': 'Trade Journal (TradersRegion) is a personal trading journal for recording decisions and reviewing results across markets. This page explains the product, its current limits, and the information practices used by the current version of the service.',
  '隱私政策摘要': 'This policy describes the information handled by the current version of the service. It is intended to make the product’s actual data flows clear; it does not replace rights available under applicable law. Please do not enter information that is not needed for your journal.',
  '官方法規參考': 'Official legal references',
