  '目前已啟用 Bybit USDT 選擇權、Bitget USDT-M 期貨、OKX USDT 永續合約、KuCoin UTA USDT-M 期貨、BingX USDT 永續合約及 MEXC USDT 合約已平倉紀錄的唯讀 API 匯入。使用者輸入憑證、選日期、預覽確認後才儲存。每個接頭只呼叫固定官方 GET 查詢端點，不提供下單、撤單、轉帳或提款功能；其他來源可能仍只有支援指南。': 'Read-only API imports are enabled for closed Bybit USDT options, Bitget USDT-M futures, OKX USDT perpetual, KuCoin UTA USDT-M futures, BingX USDT perpetual, and MEXC USDT contract positions. You enter credentials, choose dates, review the preview, and save explicitly. Each connector calls only a fixed official GET endpoint and provides no order, cancellation, transfer, or withdrawal operations; other providers may still be setup guides.',
  '目前 Bybit USDT 選擇權、Bitget USDT-M 期貨、OKX USDT 永續合約、KuCoin UTA USDT-M 期貨、BingX USDT 永續合約及 MEXC USDT 合約可匯入已平倉紀錄。使用者輸入 API Key、Secret，以及平台要求的 Passphrase 後，瀏覽器會透過 HTTPS 傳送至本站登入保護的 API 路由；伺服器只在當次請求記憶體中計算簽章，並依平台呼叫固定主機及固定歷史紀錄 GET 端點。本站程式不把憑證寫入資料庫、檔案、Cookie、本機儲存或安全事件，也不會在回應中回傳憑證；憑證在瀏覽器狀態和伺服器處理期間短暫存在，Cloudflare 等傳輸及託管服務仍會處理請求封包。交易資料只會在你檢查預覽並按儲存後寫入帳戶。每個接頭都不提供下單、撤單、轉帳或提款功能。MEXC 歷史持倉端點沒有逐筆交易手續費欄位，本站不會自行推算該數值。請為每個平台建立專用唯讀金鑰，關閉交易及資金操作權限並設定 IP 白名單（如平台支援）；若金鑰外洩，程式限制不能降低該金鑰在交易所的權限。': 'Closed-position imports are available for Bybit USDT options, Bitget USDT-M futures, OKX USDT perpetual, KuCoin UTA USDT-M futures, BingX USDT perpetual, and MEXC USDT contracts. After you enter an API Key, Secret, and any required Passphrase, the browser sends them over HTTPS to this site’s authenticated API route. The server signs and sends a request in memory to the provider’s fixed host and fixed history GET endpoint. The application does not write credentials to its database, files, cookies, local storage, or security events, and never returns them in responses. Credentials briefly exist in browser state and while the server processes the request; Cloudflare and other hosting or transport providers still handle request traffic. Trade data is saved to your account only after you review the preview and choose Save. These connectors cannot place or cancel orders, transfer funds, or withdraw funds. The MEXC position-history endpoint does not include per-trade commissions, so the site does not estimate them. Create a dedicated read-only key for each provider, disable trading and funds permissions, and configure an IP allowlist where supported. If a key is stolen, application restrictions cannot reduce the permissions granted to that key at the exchange.'
